  "description": "Make Christmas mail feel extra special with a tiny Sugarplum character on every envelope. These round sticker printables bring soft lilac, rich plum and silvery details to festive stationery, gift bags and handmade paper projects. A ballerina, fairy, elf and Santa sit alongside a nutcracker, rocking horse and adorable winter animals, giving you plenty of personalities to match with your recipients. The lace and torn paper styling pairs beautifully with cream envelopes or simple purple wrapping. Use the circles as envelope seals, little gift accents or decorative additions to a Christmas journal. Extra elf, ballerina and fairy stickers fill the sheet with more of those charming characters.\n✦ 12 round 2-inch circles\n✦ 1 two-page US Letter PDF and\n✦ 1 two-page A4 PDF. 1 printing guide PDF.\n✦ PDF sheets preserve the intended artwork size.\n✦ No cutting-machine paths or registration marks.\nPLEASE NOTE:\n✦ This product is a digital download only, no physical items will be sent to you.\n✦ Colors may slightly vary due to your monitor’s settings.\n✦ You may NOT redistribute, resell, copy or share the digital file in any way",
